{"availability":"available","full":"Charmve/computer-vision-in-action","name":"computer-vision-in-action","description":"A computer vision closed-loop learning platform where code can be run interactively online. 学习闭环《计算机视觉实战演练：算法与应用》中文电子书、源码、读者交流社区（持续更新中 ...） 📘 在线电子书 https://charmve.github.io/computer-vision-in-action/   👇项目主页","category":"Education","language":"Jupyter Notebook","stars":2870,"forks":404,"created":"2021-04-29T03:08:48Z","updated":"2024-05-27T02:44:35Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://charmve.github.io/L0CV-web","topics":["books","charmve","colab-notebook","computer-vision","computer-vision-algorithms","deep-learning","deep-learning-tutorial","handbook","in-action","ipynb","jupyter-notebook","machine-learning","neural-network","notebook","pytorch","transformer","tutorial"],"demo":"https://charmve.github.io/L0CV-web","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T22:51:53.774Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T22:51:53.774Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T22:51:53.774Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T22:51:53.774Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"curated-list","name":"Awesome Machine Learning","url":"https://github.com/josephmisiti/awesome-machine-learning"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T22:51:53.774Z","stars":2870,"forks":404}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":[],"features":["第一部分包括基础知识和预备知识。提供深度学习的入门课程，然后在理论篇中，将快速向你介绍实践计算机视觉所需的前提条件，例如如何存储和处理数据，以及如何应用基于线性代数、微积分和概率基本概念的各种数值运算，涵盖了深度学习的最基本概念和技术，例如线性回归、多层感知机和正则化。","第二部分是本书涉及的计算机视觉基础理论，核心部分为神经网络模型，包括神经网络、卷积神经网络、循环神经网络理论讲解，以图像分类、模型拟合与优化作为其代码的实战项目。在模型拟合和优化章节中，着重分享梯度下降、随机梯度下降、动量法、AdaBoost等方法。","接下来的七章集中讨论现代计算机视觉技术实战，也是本书的核心部分。围绕这样的组织逻辑：什么是计算机视觉？计算机视觉解决什么问题，都是怎么解决的？传统方法——以卷积神经网络为中心的神经网络；现代方法——Transformer、强化学习、迁移学习、生成对抗等。各种方法是如何实现的，用到了什么框架？在第7章中，描述了计算机视觉的经典卷积神经网络PyTorch实现，并为我们随后实现更复杂的模型奠定了基础。在随后的几个章节中，我们主要解决图像分类、…","该部分以项目为实战指导，给出详细的项目指导书和代码实现，更为特别的是，给出了notebook可以直接在线运行，跑通结果，免去了本地运行环境的搭建复杂性。于此同时，为了方便读者在本地调试，作者建立了一个名为 L0CV 的第三方包，可以直接在代码中 import L0CV 后使用。","第三部分讨论最近几年出现的“网红”模型，诸如：Transformer、Attention、知识蒸馏、迁移学习、生成对抗模型等。这部分也是此份资料的力挺之作。最后，在 chapoptimization 中，我们讨论了用于训练深度学习模型的几种常用优化算法，如：模型压缩、模型剪枝、微调、蒸馏等。"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Charmve/computer-vision-in-action/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0510dc8c7b9608d80f435738bd7a3da7f6066c9ac44efeffd032055b5ea4ecd0","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T22:51:53.774Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T22:51:53.774Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":null,"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"0510dc8c7b9608d80f435738bd7a3da7f6066c9ac44efeffd032055b5ea4ecd0","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Charmve/computer-vision-in-action/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T22:51:53.774Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2024-05-27T02:44:35Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Charmve/computer-vision-in-action/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T22:51:53.774Z","hash":"0510dc8c7b9608d80f435738bd7a3da7f6066c9ac44efeffd032055b5ea4ecd0","originalBytes":83378,"storedBytes":83378,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["docs","chapter2","cnn","chapter12-","pytorch","chapter13-","notebooks","transformer","jupyter","notebook","chapter11-","chapter14-","l0cv","chapter17","chapter17-","chapter7","index","chapter12","chapter12.3","chapter6","attention","normalization","optimization","chapter07","chapter8","tensorboard","image-classification","kaggle","chapter3","chapter8.1","code","github","chapter08","chapter5","chapter6.8","colab","environment-setup-and-tool-use","gan","md#","nbsp","neural-networks","transformer.md#","chapter1","chapter4","chapter6.2","cifar-10","gan.md#","imagenet","python3","pytorch-","softmax","book","chapter9","dogs","install","shell","tensorboard-","batch","chapter10","chapter16","chapter4.1","charpter10","citation","contribution","drl","gnn","google","graph","help","knowledge","license","need","network","neural","numpy","opencv","pip","python","repository","rnn","stylegan","time","action","alexnet","apache","ask"